      "cooked": "<p>Hi all,</p><p>Does Fanatic's End of Days play trigger before the the environment's start of turn cards? &nbsp;Specifically would Insula Primalas' Pterodactyl Thief already in play trigger before the End of Days?</p><p>Thanks,</p><p>Ben</p>",
